 Object]\" data-id=\"155048067959\"></p><hr style=\"box-sizing: content-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-top-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; height: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; clear: both; user-select: none; break-after: page; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><h2 data-end=\"2577\" data-start=\"2536\" id=\"\u26a0\ufe0f-New:-Region-Based-Display-Controls\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>\u26a0\ufe0f New: Region-Based Display Controls</strong></span></span></h2><p data-end=\"2662\" data-start=\"2578\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">You can now control where the cookie banner appears based on the visitor\u2019s location:</span></span></p><ul data-end=\"2888\" data-start=\"2663\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><li data-end=\"2716\" data-start=\"2663\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-end=\"2716\" data-start=\"2665\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong data-end=\"2678\" data-start=\"2665\">Worldwide</strong> \u2013 Display the banner to all visitors.</span></span></p></li><li data-end=\"2796\" data-start=\"2717\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-end=\"2796\" data-start=\"2719\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong data-end=\"2730\" data-start=\"2719\">EU &amp; UK</strong> \u2013 Display only to users in the European Union and United Kingdom.</span></span></p></li><li data-end=\"2888\" data-start=\"2797\" style=\"font