 margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\">TCR is now requiring us to <strong data-identifyelement=\"665\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">separate the checkbox for promotional SMS communications</strong> <strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">from other SMS notifications.</strong> You can omit the T&amp;C/Privacy Policy consent checkbox and make sure they are hyperlinked at the footer of the form to avoid having 3 checkboxes (T&amp;C, promotional, other sms)</span></li><li data-identifyelement=\"666\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\">You need to include the bolded part like</span><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc;\"><li data-identifyelement=\"508\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">The <strong data-identifyelement=\"509\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">type</strong> of messaging you are sending and the <strong data-identifyelement=\"510\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">business/brand name</strong></li><li data-identifyelement=\"511\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Message delivery <strong data-identifyelement=\"512\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">frequency</strong> or recurring messages disclosure (\"4 messages per month\", \"Message frequency varies\", \"1 message per login\", etc)</li><li data-identifyelement=\"513\" dir=\"ltr\" s