entifyelement=\"524\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Forwarding-Number\">Forwarding Number</a></span></h4><h4 data-identifyelement=\"525\" style=\"font-size: 14px; margin-left: 20px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"526\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"527\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Pass-Called-Number-As-Caller-ID\">Pass Called Number As Caller ID</a></span></h4><h4 data-identifyelement=\"528\" style=\"font-size: 14px; margin-left: 20px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"529\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"530\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Enable-Call-Connect\">Enable Call Connect</a></span></h4><h4 data-identifyelement=\"531\" style=\"font-size: 14px; margin-left: 20px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"532\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"533\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Whisper-Message\">Whisper Message</a></span></h4><h4 data-identifyelement=\"534\" style=\"font-size: 14px; margin-left: 20px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"535\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"536\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Call-Recording\">Call Recording</a></span></h4><h4 data-identifyelement=\"537\" style=\"font-size: 14px; margin-left: 20px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"538\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"539\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Call-Timeouts\"><strong>Call Timeouts</strong></a></span></h4><h4 data-identifyelement=\"540\" style=\"font-size: 14px; margin-left: 20px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"541\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"542\"><a data-identifyelement=\"543\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#FAQ\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"544\">FAQ</strong></a></span></h4><ul data-identifyelement=\"545\"><li data-identifyelement=\"546\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><h4 data-identifyelement=\"547\"><a data-identifyelement=\"548\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#If-Inbound/outbound-timeout-is-blank,-what-is-the-default-behavior?\"><span data-identifyelement=\"549\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">If Inbound/outbound timeout is blank, what is the default behavior?</span></a></h4></li></ul><p data-identifyelement=\"515\"><br data-identifyelement=\"516\"></p><hr data-identifyelement=\"517\"><h2 class=\"tdfocus-1673643026310\" data-identifyelement=\"541\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"518\">Where to access the phone number settings:</strong></h2><p class=\"tdfocus-1673643026310\" data-identifyelement=\"541\" dir=\"ltr\">Head into your <strong data-identifyelement=\"518\" dir=\"ltr\">Settings </strong>tab <strong>&gt;</strong><strong data-identifyelement=\"518\" dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;Phone Numbers </strong><strong>&gt;</strong> Click on the<strong data-identifyelement=\"518\" dir=\"ltr\"> \"pencil\" </strong>icon<strong class=\"tdfocus-1673643319112\" data-identifyelement=\"542\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48296865950/original/o1IZHAtHhKdQ4aUPaXD7e0393SJEniH8pg2ffc.gif?1683737358\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48296865950\" data-identifyelement=\"519\"></strong><br data-identifyelement=\"520\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"521\"><br data-identifyelement=\"522\"></p><h3 class=\"tdfocus-1673643026310\" data-identifyelement=\"541\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1673643319112\" data-identifyelement=\"542\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Number Name</strong></h3><p class=\"tdfocus-1673643120832\" data-identifyelement=\"543\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">The internal name for the phone number (maybe it\u2019s \u2018main marketing number,\u2019 or maybe you\u2019ll name it after an employee who will get assigned this number)&nbsp;</p><p data-identifyelement=\"544\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"545\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h3 class=\"tdfocus-1673643126883\" data-identifyelement=\"546\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Forwarding-Number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.38; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"547\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Forwarding Number</strong></h3><p class=\"tdfocus-1673643136801\" data-identifyelement=\"548\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">The phone number to which inbound calls are made to this new number should route (when someone calls the new number we just purchased, the call will be redirected to whatever number we save here).</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1673643139137\" data-identifyelement=\"549\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"550\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h3 class=\"tdfocus-1673643141038\" data-identifyelement=\"551\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Pass-Called-Number-As-Caller-ID\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.38; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1673643365448\" data-identifyelement=\"552\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Pass Called Number As Caller ID</strong></h3><p data-identifyelement=\"553\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">By default, if we leave this box unchecked, the phone number of whoever calls gets passed along to show in Caller Id. If we check this box, however, the system will pass the number we just purchased as the Caller ID number, which can be helpful as you\u2019ll always know you\u2019re about to answer a call from this sub-account.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"554\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"555\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h3 class=\"tdfocus-1673643157798\" data-identifyelement=\"556\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Enable-Call-Connect\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.38; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1673643366734\" data-identifyelement=\"557\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Enable Call Connect</strong></h3><p class=\"tdfocus-1673643167373\" data-identifyelement=\"558\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">If this box is not checked, incoming calls will function normally, so the call immediately connects when you answer. If we check this box, however, you\u2019ll hear a whisper message prompting you to push a button on your phone to accept the incoming call.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1673643184398\" data-identifyelement=\"559\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"560\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"561\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.38; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"562\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Why you would want to activate this feature:</strong></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1673643195659\" data-identifyelement=\"563\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; margin-left: 20px;\">Throughout the CRM, you can automate off-call statuses such as connected vs. not connected, which enables you to do powerful things like automatically sending a text message back to any inbound calls that go unanswered. We call that the Missed-Call Text-Back, which we\u2019ll learn to set up next.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"565\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 40px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"566\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1673643025036\" data-identifyelement=\"567\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 40px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.38; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">The system needs to know if a call is connected to execute automation like that. Often, it can get confused by thinking that a voicemail recording is actually a person. When that happens, the call is categorized as connected even though it really didn\u2019t connect to a human.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"568\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 40px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"569\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1673647008151\" data-identifyelement=\"570\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 40px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">We can eliminate the possibility of confusion by checking the checkbox. By checking the box, the receiver of the inbound call must press a key to connect. That way, the system always knows whether a human answered a call, which is why we recommend turning this on.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"571\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"572\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h3 class=\"tdfocus-1673643205591\" data-identifyelement=\"573\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Whisper-Message\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.38; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1673643369594\" data-identifyelement=\"574\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Whisper Message</strong></h3><p class=\"tdfocus-1673643212577\" data-identifyelement=\"575\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">The Whisper Message controls the message played to the person who answers the call when the Call-Connect features are enabled. So we would put something like \u201cLeadConnector call\u201d or \u201cCall from your sub-account name, press a key\u201d so that you know you\u2019re about to hop on a call from the system and that you need to press a key to connect.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"576\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"577\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h3 data-identifyelement=\"578\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Call-Recording\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"579\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Call Recording</strong></h3><p data-identifyelement=\"580\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">The ability to turn on call recording is incredibly powerful as we will not only record the calls, but we will also publish the recording right into the conversation stream of each contact, along with all the emails, text messages, Facebook messages, Instagram DMs, and more! If you turn this on, please be aware that most states require you to enter a whisper message here, like \u201cthis call will be recorded for quality purposes,\u201d so the caller is aware.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"581\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"582\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h3 data-identifyelement=\"583\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Call-Timeouts\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"584\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Call Timeouts</strong></h3><h4 data-identifyelement=\"553\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Inbound-timeout:The-amount-of-time-(in-seconds)-the-system-lets-the-inbound-call-ring-before-being-dropped-or-forwarded-to-a-voicemail-(personal-voicemail-or-pre-recorded-voicemail-within-the-CRM).\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 21.88px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 40px; font-size: 13px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"554\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Inbound timeout:</strong><br data-identifyelement=\"555\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">The amount of time (in seconds) the system lets the <u data-identifyelement=\"556\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">inbound call</u> ring before being dropped or forwarded to a voicemail (personal voicemail or pre-recorded voicemail within the CRM).</h4><p data-identifyelement=\"557\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 60px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"558\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"559\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Scenario 1:</strong> If you want the lead to reach your cellphone voicemail, you can leave this field blank or add 60 secs.<br data-identifyelement=\"560\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"561\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"562\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Scenario 2:&nbsp;</strong>If you want the line to ring and the lead to reach a pre-recorded voicemail set within the CRM, add the inbound call timeout to around 20+/- seconds. Setting a short timeout will ensure the line doesn't ring long enough to reach your personal voicemail recording.<br data-identifyelement=\"563\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"564\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"565\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Scenario 3:&nbsp;</strong>If you want inbound calls to go straight to the pre-recorded voicemail within the CRM, set the inbound call timeout to 1-4 seconds. This will ensure that the voicemail set within the CRM is used.<span data-identifyelement=\"566\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">&nbsp;If so, you must ensure you have uploaded a voicemail (MP3/WAV file) within the \"Business Profile\" tab or the <a data-identifyelement=\"567\" href=\"https://help.gohighlevel.com/en/support/solutions/articles/48001152124\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: inherit; user-select: auto;\" target=\"_blank\">assigned users' profile settings</a>.</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"568\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 100px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"569\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br data-identifyelement=\"570\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"571\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h4 data-identifyelement=\"572\" id=\"Outbound-timeout:&nbsp;The-amount-of-time-(in-seconds)-the-system-lets-the-outbound-call-ring-before-dropping-the-call.-Setting-a-shorter-outbound-timeout-to-30-+/--seconds-will-reduce-your-chances-of-reaching-the-customer's/leads-voicemail.-This-is-ideal-if-you-run-voicemail-drop-campaigns-or-your-agents-have-large-lists-and-only-want-to-speak-to-readily-available-leads.\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 21.88px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 40px; font-size: 13px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"573\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Outbound timeout:&nbsp;</strong><br data-identifyelement=\"574\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">The amount of time (in seconds) the system lets the <u data-identifyelement=\"575\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">outbound</u> call ring <span data-identifyelement=\"576\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">before dropping the call. Setting a shorter outbound timeout to 30 +/- seconds will reduce your chances of reaching the customer's/leads voicemail. This is ideal if you run <a data-identifyelement=\"577\" href=\"https://help.gohighlevel.com/en/support/solutions/articles/48000981430\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: inherit; user-select: auto;\" target=\"_blank\">voicemail drop campaigns</a> or your agents have large lists and only want to speak too readily available leads.</span></h4><p data-identifyelement=\"557\"><br data-identifyelement=\"558\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"559\"><br data-identifyelement=\"560\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"561\"><br data-identifyelement=\"562\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"563\"><br data-identifyelement=\"564\"></p><h1 class=\"tdfocus-1673643240508\" data-identifyelement=\"585\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"FAQ\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 43.75px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 2em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"565\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">FAQ</strong></h1><h3 class=\"tdfocus-1673643240508\" data-identifyelement=\"585\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"If-Inbound/outbound-timeout-is-blank,-what-is-the-default-behavior?\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"566\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">If Inbound/outbound timeout is blank, what is the default behavior?</strong></h3><p class=\"tdfocus-1673643240508\" data-identifyelement=\"585\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &qu