: break-word; width: 579.872px;\"><p data-identifyelement=\"385\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.2; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"386\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Notification of a compromised system (software or hardware related)</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 data-identifyelement=\"387\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.38; color: inherit; margin-bottom: 4pt; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"388\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></h3><h3 data-identifyelement=\"389\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.38; color: inherit; margin-bottom: 4pt; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"390\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(67, 67, 67); font-weight: 400;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"391\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Special Campaign Use Cases</strong></span></h3><p data-identifyelement=\"392\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"393\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"394\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.38; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"395\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">There are some use cases that carriers consider \"Special,\" with additional requirements and (in some cases) different fees. These include Charity / 501(c)(3) Nonprofit, Emergency Services, and Political use cases, among others.&nbsp;</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"396\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.38; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"397\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"398\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.38; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"399\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 24px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"400\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"401\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></strong></span></p><h3 data-identifyelement=\"402\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.38; color: inherit; margin-bottom: 4pt; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"403\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(67, 67, 67); font-weight: 400;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"404\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Low-Volume Use Cases</strong></span></h3><p data-identifyelement=\"405\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"406\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"407\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.38; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"408\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">In addition to the standard \"Mixed/Marketing\" use case, there is a separate Campaign use case designated as\"Low Volume Mixed\"\u2013 this option supports the same multiple use cases, but has a&nbsp;</span><span data-identifyelement=\"409\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"410\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-weight: 400; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">lower monthly fee</span></span><span data-identifyelement=\"411\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;than a standard Campaign and is fixed at the&nbsp;</span><span data-identifyelement=\"412\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); font-weight: 400; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\"><a href=\"155000004617.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lowest throughput tier</a></span><span data-identifyelement=\"414\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;below, regardless of your Trust Score.</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"415\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"416\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"></p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000000166-how-to-reschedule-an-email-campaign-email-builder-", "title": "How to reschedule an email campaign? (LeadConnector)", "folder": "Email Builder", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48227948757/original/31_AaJpqQwrqbNtjim_i5EXMTWQTIf8rbg797c.png?1653391715"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p data-identifyelement=\"504\" dir=\"ltr\"></p><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-1a4b0092-4c8c-475a-8260-6af2104ddf4a\" data-identifyelement=\"509\" dir=\"ltr\">Rescheduling of Email Campaign is possible for Simple Schedule, Batch Schedule, and <strong data-identifyelement=\"510\">RSS Schedule one hour (60mins) ahead of the execution date.&nbsp;</strong></div><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-8bca771b-a08b-4003-9c15-57e5148b9eb3\" data-identifyelement=\"511\"><br data-identifyelement=\"512\"></div><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-f2648662-463e-4dd3-85f1-288b12e66f33\" data-identifyelement=\"513\" dir=\"ltr\">The user will be required to visit Marketing &gt; Email. Please visit the Email Campaign tab: it will have a list of Email Campaigns listed with Simple Schedule, RSS Schedule, and Batch Schedule, which can be rescheduled one hour after</div><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-f2648662-463e-4dd3-85f1-288b12e66f33\" data-identifyelement=\"514\" dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;the execution date/time.</div><hr data-identifyelement=\"524\"><h2 data-identifyelement=\"525\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"526\">Steps to Reschedule an Email Campaign</strong></h2><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-0e9b3af7-ea32-42ae-a850-f8b9daa228c1\" data-identifyelement=\"527\"><br data-identifyelement=\"528\"></div><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-445a4fed-de12-4b2c-a640-04e44cc713b1\" data-identifyelement=\"529\" dir=\"ltr\">1. Under the action button drop-down, select <strong data-identifyelement=\"530\">Reschedule Campaign</strong>.</div><p data-identifyelement=\"531\"><br data-identifyelement=\"532\"></p><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-485c6c67-aa47-496a-abe8-588da01b7a65\" data-identifyelement=\"533\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48227948757/original/31_AaJpqQwrqbNtjim_i5EXMTWQTIf8rbg797c.png?1653391715\" style=\"width: 371px; display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: auto; text-align: center;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48227948757\" data-identifyelement=\"534\"></div><p><br></p><p><br></p><p data-identifyelement=\"535\"><br data-identifyelement=\"536\"></p><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-445a4fed-de12-4b2c-a640-04e44cc713b1\" data-identifyelement=\"537\" dir=\"ltr\">2. The user can change the Schedule's details and change the delivery model. Once the changes are done, the user must mark it as the rescheduled campaign to save the settings.</div><p class=\"fd-toc\" data-identifyelement=\"538\"><br data-identifyelement=\"539\"></p><p class=\"fd-toc\" data-identifyelement=\"538\"><br></p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000004914-updated-messaging-policies-for-canadian-10dlc-numbers-a2p-registration-requirements", "title": "Updated Messaging Policies for Canadian 10DLC Numbers: A2P Registration Requirements", "folder": "SMS", "images": [], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p data-end=\"216\" data-start=\"97\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem]\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">To align with industry standards, we are updating our messaging policies concerning Canadian 10-digit long code (10DLC) numbers.</span> <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem]\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">These changes pertain to messages sent from Canadian numbers to recipients in both the United States and Canada.</span></p><p data-end=\"234\" data-start=\"218\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong data-end=\"234\" data-start=\"218\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Key Changes:</strong></p><ol data-end=\"580\" data-start=\"236\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><li data-end=\"373\" data-start=\"236\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"286\" data-start=\"239\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-end=\"286\" data-start=\"239\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Messaging from Canada to the United States:</strong></p><ul data-end=\"373\" data-start=\"290\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc;\"><li data-end=\"373\" data-start=\"290\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"373\" data-start=\"292\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem]\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Effective immediately, all messages sent from Canadian 10DLC numbers to U.S. recipients must originate from Application-to-Person (A2P) registered numbers. This requirement applies to both new and existing Canadian numbers.</span></p></li></ul></li><li data-end=\"580\" data-start=\"375\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"406\" data-start=\"378\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-end=\"406\" data-start=\"378\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Messaging within Canada:</strong></p><ul data-end=\"580\" data-start=\"410\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc;\"><li data-end=\"493\" data-start=\"410\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"493\" data-start=\"412\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem]\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">For new Canadian 10DLC numbers purchased after 26th March 2025, A2P registration is mandatory to send messages to Canadian recipients.</span></p></li><li data-end=\"580\" data-start=\"497\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"580\" data-start=\"499\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem]\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Existing Canadian 10DLC numbers used for messaging within Canada are not required to undergo A2P registration at this time, except as noted in point 1.</span></p></li></ul></li></ol><p data-end=\"602\" data-start=\"582\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong data-end=\"602\" data-start=\"582\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Important Notes:</strong></p><ul data-end=\"689\" data-start=\"604\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><li data-end=\"689\" data-start=\"604\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"689\" data-start=\"606\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem]\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">These updates apply exclusively to 10DLC numbers. Toll-Free (TF) numbers are not affected and will continue to operate under existing guidelines.</span><span class=\"ml-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem]\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-left: 1px;\"><a class=\"flex h-6 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2.5 text-[0.5625em] font-medium !bg-[#F4F4F4] !text-token-text-secondary dark:!bg-[#303030]\" href=\"https://simpletexting.com/sms-compliance/10dlc-registration/?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 92, 197); user-select: auto;\"></a></span></p></li></ul><p data-end=\"732\" data-start=\"691\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong data-end=\"732\" data-start=\"691\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Understanding A2P 10DLC Registration:</strong></p><p data-end=\"899\" data-start=\"734\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem]\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">A2P 10DLC is a system that allows businesses to send Application-to-Person type messaging via standard 10-digit long code phone numbers.</span> <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem]\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Registering your numbers under this framework helps ensure compliance with carrier regulations and enhances message deliverability.</span> <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem]\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">For a comprehensive overview of A2P 10DLC and answers to common questions, please refer to our <a href=\"https://help.gohighlevel.com/support/solutions/articles/155000002380-what-is-a2p-10-dlc-brand-and-campaign-registration-summary-and-faqs\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 92, 197); user-select: auto;\">support article.</a></span></p><p data-end=\"918\" data-start=\"901\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong data-end=\"918\" data-start=\"901\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Action Steps:</strong></p><ul data-end=\"1311\" data-start=\"920\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><li data-end=\"1070\" data-start=\"920\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1070\" data-start=\"922\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-end=\"984\" data-start=\"922\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">For Existing Canadian 10DLC Numbers Messaging to the U.S.:</strong> <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem]\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">If your number is not yet A2P registered, please initiate the registration process promptly to comply with the new requirements.</span></p></li><li data-end=\"1195\" data-start=\"1072\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1195\" data-start=\"1074\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-end=\"1109\" data-start=\"1074\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">For New Canadian 10DLC Numbers:</strong> <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem]\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Ensure A2P registration is completed before initiating messaging to recipients in either the U.S. or Canada.</span></p></li><li data-end=\"1311\" data-start=\"1197\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1311\" data-start=\"1199\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-end=\"1225\" data-start=\"1199\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">For Toll-Free Numbers:</strong> <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem]\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">No action is required; existing policies remain in effect.</span></p></li></ul><p data-end=\"1333\" data-start=\"1313\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong data-end=\"1333\" data-start=\"1313\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">How to Register:</strong></p><p data-end=\"1460\" data-start=\"1335\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem]\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">To register your Canadian 10DLC numbers for A2P messaging, please follow the step-by-step instructions provided in our <a data-end=\"268\" data-start=\"119\" href=\"https://help.gohighlevel.com/support/solutions/articles/155000004539-campaign-registration-step-by-step-guide-and-faqs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 92, 197); user-select: auto;\" target=\"_new\">Campaign Registration Guide</a>.</span> <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem]\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">This guide offers detailed information on the registration process, including best practices to ensure approval.</span></p><p data-end=\"1474\" data-start=\"1462\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong data-end=\"1474\" data-start=\"1462\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Support:</strong></p><p data-end=\"1641\" data-start=\"1476\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem]\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">We understand that these changes may raise questions or require adjustments to your current messaging practices.</span> <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem]\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Our support team is available to assist you through this transition.</span></p><p data-end=\"1728\" data-start=\"1643\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem]\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Thank you for your attention to these updates and for your continued trust in our services.</span></p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000006878-how-to-set-up-the-sender-preferences-in-email-builder", "title": "How to Set Up the Sender Preferences in Email Builder", "folder": "Campaign Settings/Functionalities", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057347785/original/UznabZ21yoAId1yWrkaZYepvdzPiCjQE1Qdbfb.jpg?1761942759", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057347787/original/-EsMpxf0qJDue1ywDBnt-4ggoouKuUFeEwdbfb.jpg?1761942759", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057347790/original/OR4C1sR4KjVNLEx3Xt4Eatv-9TH9vYa6mA46f8.jpg?1761942760", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057347782/original/_dJc91FCtm95VKU6UlryMvrP1hBb4kddFAd768.jpg?1761942758", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057347788/original/TyztZR9cjP8zHSF_FO8FPZXyWu-aV1qe3A46f8.jpg?1761942760", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057347789/original/rs7NaSzxOeyBxnm2TcC2PaFUjxdpXg2kcg46f8.jpg?1761942760", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057347784/original/0GhdZRu9QKwtFy_ACn992UDqHFBh6KUGEwdbfb.jpg?1761942759", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057347783/original/MDirks3sDk9eTBiL3POiFep4WvKE-AowJgdbfb.jpg?1761942759", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057347786/original/cO6kxjJnbyUtRtak-lUoau6w2LmOgDHHQwdbfb.jpg?1761942759"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p class=\"p1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Sender Preferences let you set default details like <span class=\"s1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">From Name, From Email, Reply-To, and Test Recipient(s)</strong></span> for all your email campaigns and test sends. In this guide, you\u2019ll learn what Sender Preferences are, why they matter for speed, accuracy, and deliverability, and how to set them up step by step. You\u2019ll also find best practices, tips for maintenance, and answers to common questions so your emails always look professional and consistent.</p><p class=\"fd-toc\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">TABLE OF CONTENTS</strong></p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><a href=\"https://help.gohighlevel.com/a/solutions/articles/155000005908?portalId=48000045315#%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8BWhat-are-Sender-Preferences-in-Email-Builder?\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 92, 197);\">What are Sender Preferences in Email Builder?</a></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><a href=\"https://help.gohighlevel.com/a/solutions/articles/155000005908?portalId=48000045315#Key-Benefits-of-Sender-Preferences\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 92, 197);\">Key Benefits of Sender Preferences</a></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><a href=\"https://help.gohighlevel.com/a/solutions/articles/155000005908?portalId=48000045315#How-to-Configure-the-Sender-Preferences-in-Email-Builder\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 92, 197);\">How to Configure the Sender Preferences in Email Builder</a></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://help.gohighlevel.com/a/solutions/articles/155000005908?portalId=48000045315#Frequently-Asked-Questions\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 92, 197);\">Frequently Asked Questions</a></li></ul><h1 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 43.75px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-size: 2em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">What are Sender Preferences in Email Builder?</strong></h1><p class=\"p2\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p class=\"p3\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Sender Preferences allow you to define the default&nbsp;<span class=\"s2\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">From Name, From Email, Reply-To, and Test Recipient(s)</strong></span> for emails created in the Email Builder. These defaults automatically populate in your test sends and new marketing campaigns, saving time and ensuring that sender details remain consistent across your communications. By setting them once, you reduce repetitive typing and lower the risk of mistakes, such as typos or mismatched sender information.</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p class=\"p3\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">These defaults act as a&nbsp;<span class=\"s2\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">starting point</strong></span>\u2014they auto-fill when you create a new campaign or test, but you can still override them for individual sends when needed. It\u2019s important to know that updates to Sender Preferences will only apply to new campaigns or tests you create; existing drafts and scheduled emails will keep their current settings unless you update them manually. This makes Sender Preferences a powerful tool for efficiency and brand consistency while still giving you flexibility when specific campaigns require unique sender details.</p><h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Key Benefits of Sender Preferences</strong></h2><p class=\"p2\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p class=\"p3\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Using Sender Preferences in Email Builder helps teams save time, reduce errors, and keep campaigns consistent. Here\u2019s how this feature addresses common challenges in email marketing:</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li class=\"p1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Faster Setup</strong></span> \u2013 Stop retyping sender details for every campaign. Your default From Name, Email, and Reply-To auto-fill instantly, so you can launch faster.</li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li class=\"p1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Error Reduction</strong></span> \u2013 Avoid typos or inconsistent sender information across emails. Defaults ensure every campaign starts with accurate, brand-approved details.</li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li class=\"p1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Brand Consistency</strong></span> \u2013 Present a uniform sender identity to your audience. Consistent \u201cFrom\u201d information builds trust and strengthens brand recognition.</li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li class=\"p1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Efficient Testing</strong></span> \u2013 Store QA inboxes as Test Recipient(s), so proof emails always go to the right people without needing to enter addresses manually.</li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li class=\"p1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Flexible Control</strong></span> \u2013 Even with defaults in place, you can override sender details per campaign when special branding, teams, or replies require adjustments.</li></ul><p class=\"p1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h1 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 43.75px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-size: 2em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700